  ~ SIMILAR: Pythium Root And Stem Rot | Globisporangium Ultimum | Phytophthora Root And Stem Rot
    Oomycete root/stem rot entries that overlap taxonomically (Globisporangium ultimum = former Pythium ultimum) and symptomatically.

  ~ SIMILAR: Common Scab Of Potato | Powdery Scab | Scurf | Streptomyces Soil Rot
    Scab/scurf-type tuber surface diseases that are easily confused; Scurf and Streptomyces Soil Rot are actually sweetpotato diseases.

  ~ SIMILAR: Bacterial Soft Rot | Rhizopus Soft Rots | Sour Rot | Bread Mold
