  ~ SIMILAR: Diaporthe Destruens | Fusarium Root Rot Of Sweetpotato | Java Black Rot | Scurf | Streptomyces Soil Rot | Sweet Potato Feathery Mottle Virus
    All are sweetpotato (Ipomoea batatas) diseases mistakenly included under potato (Solanum tuberosum).

